WEBVTT

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:34.290
To save Gourry,
who's been kidnapped...

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:37.320
...we've all arrived in Sairaag.

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:40.880
But the city of Sairaag's been
turned by Phibrizzo's magic...

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:43.330
...into a city of
the walking dead.

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:45.800
And now we move even deeper
into Phibrizzo's clutches!

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:35.750
Hang on, Gourry!
I'm coming to save you!

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.750
Damn! There's no end to them!

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:48.020
Elmekia Lance!

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.870
At this rate, they'll
get us eventually!

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:59.540
So, what are we
going to DO about it?!

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:33.330
Where?

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:37.070
Looks like we're supposed
to go down to the bottom.

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:53.590
No way we're taking
the slow way down!

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:54.420
Miss Lina!

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:02.930
What's that?

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.670
What is this?

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.690
What the!?

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:41.870
Father!

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:52.010
Who are all these people?

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.350
The inhabitants of Sairaag.

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:55.220
The what?!

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.350
Welcome to my temple!

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:18.210
You've finally made it.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:20.880
I've been waiting
a long time f or you.

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:23.380
Who's this arrogant little brat?

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:25.470
That's Phibrizzo.

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:26.520
What?!

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:33.580
It can't be... This child?

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:36.960
He uses that f orm to
trick people. The jerk...

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:42.060
But he has double or triple the
power of any other Monster we've seen.

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:46.840
I see... If YOU say
he's that bad, then...

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:52.010
Exactly. And what's the
deal with all this?!

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.570
Oh, this thing?

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.810
It's a nice little
decoration, isn't it?

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:59.370
To someone with no taste!

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:04.750
This object contains the souls
of all the dead of Sairaag.

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:11.820
Those things causing
the fuss outside...

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:16.460
...are just shadows of these
people I create using my power.

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:20.700
I make them do what I want.
Convenient puppets f or me.

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:29.940
You see, all my servants were
destroyed a thousand years ago.

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:33.780
Xellos is still out of action
because of his wounds...

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:36.150
...so they have to
help me in his place.

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:38.350
Too bad about that.

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:41.260
And you thought something like this
would make me cast the Giga Slave?

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:44.020
Perhaps. However...

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:48.800
I pref er f or them to simply chase
you and keep you from escaping.

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:52.130
They serve very
well in THAT role.

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:53.470
You fiend!

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:54.270
Hold it!

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:57.630
One more thing bef ore that.

00:06:57.710 --> 00:06:59.110
Where is Gourry?

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:01.740
Oh, yes! That guy...

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.290
Gourry dear!

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:17.850
Don't worry. He isn't dead...
For the moment, anyway.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.730
For the moment?

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:25.130
Yes. A living being locked
inside of the crystal...

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:28.940
...slowly dies as their lif e energy
is gradually drained away.

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:32.270
Leave him in there too long, and...

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:34.070
No!

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:35.740
You've gotta be kidding!

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:41.050
To save him, you must def eat me.
That's the only way...

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:45.580
Then that simplifies things!
I'll slice you in half!

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:59.600
You still don't realize how
powerful I am, do you?

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:01.570
Very well...

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:08.210
I'll demonstrate one more time.

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:12.510
Damn! There's no end to them!

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:14.810
Mr. Zelgadis! Look out!

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.560
Amelia!

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:21.220
DIEM WING!

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:25.160
Are you all right? Amelia!

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:28.500
I don't think this is going to work...

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:31.100
Damn! At this rate...

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:33.730
Of course! We can try that!

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:35.900
Martina! Come on!
I've f ound a way out!

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:38.670
A way out?! Where?! Where?!

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:40.740
Here! BEHFIS BRING!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.590
What's the big idea?!

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:55.690
The underground passages! Left over
from when Flagoon was in this city.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:58.290
Those people won't be able
to f ollow us down here.

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:01.020
Sorry, but you'll have to cast
a healing spell on yourself.

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:02.930
S- Sure...

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:04.870
Let's go!

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:08.030
Wha?! Hey, wait f or me!

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:16.910
And?

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:18.710
Damn it!

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:22.880
He's almost too powerful
f or us. Do I have to use it?!

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:24.650
Wait, please!

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:25.820
Sylphiel?

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:30.850
I have an idea. Miss Lina,
please try a Dragon Slave.

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:33.060
It may be powerful enough.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:36.530
But a Dragon Slave
wouldn't work on Phibrizzo.

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:38.590
Please, just do it!

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:42.230
I don't know what you're
thinking, but I'll give it a try.

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:48.540
"Lord of Darkness
of the Four Worlds!"

00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:52.710
"I call upon you! Grant me all
the power that you possess!"

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:55.510
So, Miss, you're finally
getting into this.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.820
"Darkness beyond twilight..."

00:09:57.890 --> 00:10:01.050
"Crimson beyond blood that flows!
Buried in the flow of time..."

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:04.560
"ln thy great name,
I pledge myself to darkness."

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.930
"Let all the f ools who stand
in our way be destroyed..."

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:14.070
What, Lord Ruby-Eye's spell?
But that won't work.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:17.770
DRAGON SLAVE!!!

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:28.120
Even amplified,
it still doesn't work!

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.380
Totally ineff ective, Miss...

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:35.020
"Let all the f ools who stand
in our way be destroyed..."

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:36.750
"...by the power
you and I possess!"

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:37.490
What?!

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:39.760
DRAGON SLAVE!!!

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:45.340
lmpossible!

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:10.750
A... A Dragon Slave?!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.970
AGH! I'm gonna die!

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:29.670
"Whew?!" Since when
can you cast that spell?!

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:31.840
Huh? Um, well...

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:34.410
I've been practicing
since we were last together.

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:38.550
I thought if I was going to travel with
Gourry, I should be able to do this.

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:41.760
Black Magic isn't in the
housewif e's handbook!

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:46.320
Oh, no. To be exact, I'm just
specializing in the Dragon Slave.

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:48.730
Anyway, let's get
dear Gourry out first!

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:49.820
R- Right!

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:04.380
Why?! Shouldn't killing Phibrizzo
have broken the crystal spell?

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:06.380
You think he was lying?

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:10.350
I wasn't lying. You just
haven't killed me yet!

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:25.070
Wasn't expecting that. A double
Dragon Slave attack, huh?

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.300
