00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:30.570
Like a lizard dropping its
own tail to escape...

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:34.310
I left part of me here while my
main body retreated into subspace.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:40.210
Well, if you'd hit me full on,
even I might not have survived it.

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:43.790
Still, you surprised me.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:46.290
And f or that I'll now
have to punish you well!

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:49.490
What are we going to do?!
We're!

00:13:00.270 --> 00:13:01.600
Zel! Amelia!

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:02.330
What?!

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:04.970
Huh? Miss Lina!
Where are we?

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:07.030
Your own graveyard!

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:13.450
Yes... I brought you all here.
Lina Inverse!

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:17.450
I brought them so you could
watch them die one by one!

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.080
What did you say?!

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:23.590
Wonder why they call me Hellmaster?
Let me show you!

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:26.030
We'll start with you.

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:33.900
Amelia!

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:37.670
I'm... okay... I'm... okay...

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:43.310
Amelia!

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:46.320
No! It can't be!

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:48.550
Sylphiel!
Use a resurrection spell!

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:49.610
Too late...

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:51.180
Amelia!

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:54.090
Stop playing around!

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:56.960
The controller of death.
That's who I am.

00:13:57.130 --> 00:13:59.720
Human lives are my toys.

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:04.600
Lina Inverse!
Until you use the Giga Slave...

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:08.130
...do you think I won't keep
right on killing your friends?

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:12.270
So naive...

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:15.410
I won't f orgive you!

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:19.310
"Darkness beyond twilight,
crimson beyond blood that flows!"

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:20.680
Sylphiel!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.620
"Buried in the flow of
time. In thy great..."

00:14:27.390 --> 00:14:28.620
Sylphiel!

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:32.460
F- Father...

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:46.530
Oh, how terrible. So, f eel
like using the Giga Slave now?

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:52.080
You son of a!!!

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:00.060
ZEL! ZEL!

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:05.350
Come on, Lina! Do something!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:08.260
You must know a
spell that can kill him!

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:11.960
What are you waiting f or?!
He's really killing everyone!

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:13.470
Hold it! Hold it!

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:16.270
I know when I'm beat.
I surrender! I surrender!

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:20.610
I was just passing by,
so let me go, okay?

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:22.610
Zangulus...

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:25.110
Please, I beg you!

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:39.020
Nearly... got you...

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:40.830
Zangulus!

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:47.070
Heh... Looks like you're
the only one left, now...

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:50.340
Convince Lina... Ignite
the fighting spirit inside her...

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:54.970
I can't do anything! Without Lord
Zoamelgustar, I can't do a thing!

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:59.440
No... Look inside
yourself f or the strength...

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:03.380
I know... you can do it...

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:18.070
Get up! Lina! Stand up!

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:21.000
Stand up and kill that thing!

00:16:21.070 --> 00:16:22.600
Martina...

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:23.660
MARTINA!

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:31.980
Martina!

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:36.280
Wh- What are you doing?
This isn't... like you...

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:38.980
No! No, don't talk! Martina!

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:43.290
You... want to save him...
don't you? Gourry...

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:45.350
You love him... don't you?

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:51.100
Now stop this... Be honest
with your own f eelings!

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:55.170
Even if the entire
world is destroyed...

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:58.770
...it doesn't...
matter... does it?

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:01.070
Martina!

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:02.310
MARTINA!

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:09.080
Phibrizzo!

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:12.320
Well? Do you f eel like
casting the Giga Slave NOW?

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:14.580
