I'll do next, don't you?

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:26.270
These crystals are
the crystallized essence...

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:28.600
...of the lif e that's
left their bodies.

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:31.730
If I smash them,
your friends really will die.

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:35.140
But, I promise: if you def eat me,
they'll all be saved.

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:40.840
