man here? I know!

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:04.540
Let's start with HIM!

00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:07.240
Unless you do something,
he's about to die.

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:13.740
GOURRY!

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:20.350
I don't care who I get it from!
Give me the power to kill Phibrizzo!

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:23.120
If I can do that, I don't
care what happens to me!

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:28.060
"Darkness beyond blackest pitch,
deeper than the deepest night..."

00:18:29.230 --> 00:18:31.330
At last, you're finally ready.

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:38.400
"King of Darkness, who shines like
gold upon the Sea of Chaos!"

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:42.870
If I lose control of this energy,
I can destroy the world!

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:46.080
But right now, I choose
Gourry over the entire world!

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:49.090
Gourry...
Give me the strength I need!

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:53.950
"I call upon thee!
Swear myself to thee!"

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:57.430
"Let the f ools who stand
bef ore me be destroyed..."

00:18:57.930 --> 00:19:02.960
"...by the power
you and I possess!"

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:17.910
The moment I've been waiting f or!

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:27.720
Now I'll destroy her body!
The chaos energy will run wild!

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:37.790
