by the souls of the dead!

00:20:00.520 --> 00:20:03.460
Yes! Rage out of control,
energy of chaos!

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:05.860
Devour everything in this world!

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:18.980
She controls it... The power...

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:22.770
You who stand bef ore me,
desiring destruction...

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:23.950
It can't be!

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:27.280
...my power shall destroy YOU!

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:35.490
That won't work.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:41.200
Wh- Who are you?!

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:43.360
I am the mother of all darkness.

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:46.630
I am one who has dreamed f or years
uncounted of regaining my f orm.

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:49.600
I am a darkness
beyond blackest pitch.

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:51.510
Deeper than the deepest night.

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:55.030
I am the sea of chaos.
The source of all chaos.

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:58.150
That is how you describe me...

00:20:58.220 --> 00:21:01.550
I am... the Lord of Nightmares.
